{"id":8834733015239,"title":"Cardinals Perched on Branch with Roses Patchwork Winter Quilt","handle":"cardinals-perched-on-branch-with-roses-patchwork-winter-quilt-21ac904cd7-21ac904cd7","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your bedroom into a warm and cozy winter retreat with the Cardinal Quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully printed design of realistic cardinals perched on branches among roses, this soft and lightweight quilt set adds a perfect touch of festive holiday spirit or everyday natural beauty to any guest room, kid's room, or master suite.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize your quilt by adding your name or special custom text for a truly unique look.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes one beautiful lightweight quilt, with optional matching pillowcases (2 or 4 pieces) to complete your bedding set.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Comforting Materials:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with a breathable soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth and comfort in all seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose the perfect fit for your bed, available in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care \u0026amp; Maintenance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Extremely simple to clean; machine wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. It dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Excellent as an indoor bed quilt, couch throw blanket, or for outdoor activities like camping and picnics.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u